    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "BON Market \n\nBON Market is a vibrant, welcoming space that brings together local women-led businesses and artists from Ottawa’s African and Caribbean diasporas. Rooted in the spirit of Ubuntu - “I am because we are” - the market is a celebration of community, creativity, and shared cultural pride. \n\nExperience handcrafted goods, fashion, art, food, and meet community leaders that reflect the richness and diversity of our city. More than a marketplace, BON Market is a gathering place where stories are exchanged, connections are built, and local creators are supported and uplifted. \n\nWhether you’re browsing, shopping, or meeting new people BON..."
      }
    ],
